---
layout: base.njk
description: "Give it your website. Prospektor finds the companies worth approaching, names who to write to, and writes the pitch in your voice."
# One page per language the build knows (#114): `/` in English, `/es/` and so
# on for every catalogue under src/_data/strings/. Every sentence below sits
# in a {% t %} block and renders untouched on the English page; the pagination
# is what makes the other languages exist at all. Nothing here lists them.
pagination:
  data: languages
  size: 1
  alias: language
  addAllPagesToCollections: true
permalink: "{{ language.prefix }}/"
---

{#- The homepage in the Keep-your-CRM style (#1398, 17 Nov 2026, out of
    #1092's studio look and #1396's flow map): a white ground with grey bands,
    bold headlines that end in a full stop, drawn product frames and never a
    photo, one dark closing band, and coral on exactly one press, the scan
    field's. The order under the hero is the one shootpick.com's home page
    taught: the product in one frame, three numbered steps, the map, what
    you get, the price, the close.

    The operator on the draft: "keep it minimal and clean. I want the primary
    CTA still to be clearly to scan the site and not immediately go into
    product screenshots." So the hero is the promise, one sentence, the field
    and one quiet line to the demo, and nothing else.

    #207: the anchor is the SECTION, not the field inside it. Every "Scan your
    site" on this site is a /#scan jump; the hero is the first thing in the
    document, so the target resolves to scroll 0 and the headline and the
    field arrive together. test/drive.js §6b measures it. -#}
<section class="hero" id="scan">
  {#- .hero-rest collapses when a scan starts (scan.js adds .scan-focus to
      the hero): from that moment the scan is the page. -#}
  <div class="hero-rest" id="heroRest">
    {#- #453: the h1 carries the words the <title> shows (site.tagline), and
        test/pages.test.js holds the two together. -#}
    <p class="eyebrow">{% t %}For teams that sell to companies{% endt %}</p>
    <h1>{% t %}Find Leads.<br><span class="accent">That fit you.</span>{% endt %}</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">{% t %}Give it your website. It finds the companies worth approaching, names who decides, writes the first email and puts each one into your CRM.{% endt %}</p>
  </div>

  <!-- The scan field: POST /api/scan, poll, render the proposal. scan.js drives it. -->
  <div class="scan-hero">
    <form class="scan-form" id="scanForm" novalidate>
      <div class="scan-q">
        <svg class="scan-q-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"></circle><path d="M20 20l-3.5-3.5"></path></svg>
        {#- #241: the field is a combobox over #scanSuggest; the browser's own
            URL autofill is off so it cannot draw a second list over ours. -#}
        <input class="scan-input" id="scanInput" type="text" inputmode="url" autocomplete="off"
               role="combobox" aria-autocomplete="list" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="scanSuggest"
               spellcheck="false" placeholder="yourcompany.com" aria-label="{% t %}Your company website{% endt %}">
      </div>
      <button class="scan-btn" type="submit" id="scanBtn">{% t %}Find my leads{% endt %}</button>
      {#- #241: companies matching what has been typed, one line each (name,
          domain), written by scan.js from the site's own company-suggest
          function. Picking one fills the field; nothing else moves. -#}
      <ul class="scan-suggest" id="scanSuggest" role="listbox" hidden></ul>
    </form>
    {#- The hint and the demo's door (#767) read as one line under the field.
        The door is a link and never a second button (style rule 8), and it
        goes with the rest of the hero the moment a scan starts. -#}
    <div class="scan-hints">
      <p class="scan-hint" id="scanHint">{% t %}Free, no sign-up, about 30 seconds.{% endt %}</p>
      <p class="scan-demo" id="scanDemo"><a href="{{ '/demo/' | localize }}">{% t %}Or click through the demo.{% endt %}</a></p>
    </div>
    <p class="scan-error" id="scanError" hidden></p>

    <div aria-live="polite">
      <div class="scan-status" id="scanStatus" hidden>
        <div class="scan-progress"><div class="scan-progress-fill" id="scanBarFill"></div></div>
        <div class="scan-status-line"><span class="building-dot"></span><span id="scanStatusMsg"></span></div>
      </div>

      {#- #240: one card, the exact width of the search bar above it. Name +
          domain, fact chips, the proposal: that's the whole result. -#}
      <div class="scan-result" id="scanResult" hidden>
        <div class="scan-card">
          <div class="scan-card-head">
            <span class="scan-card-name" id="scanName"></span>
            <span class="scan-card-domain" id="scanDomain"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="scan-chips" id="scanFacts" hidden></div>
          <p class="scan-lead">{% t %}Here's what Prospektor will find for you:{% endt %}</p>
          {#- Not a heading (#137): written by scan.js after the fetch returns. -#}
          <p class="scan-guess" id="scanGuess" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
          {#- #419: the free run is the primary action here, not checkout. The
              way to pay stays on the card as one quiet line, demoted and never
              removed, because the reader who is already sold must not have to
              hunt for it. -#}
          <div class="scan-cta-row">
            <a class="btn-cta" id="scanRunCta" href="https://studio.prospektor.ai/r">{% t %}Show me the companies →{% endt %}</a>
            <p class="scan-cta-note">{% t %}Free, no sign-up.{% endt %} <a id="scanCta" data-signup href="{{ site.studio }}/signup{% if language.code != 'en' %}?lang={{ language.code }}{% endif %}">{% t %}Start my studio →{% endt %}</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="scan-fallback" id="scanFallback" hidden>
        <p class="scan-fallback-msg" id="scanFallbackMsg" hidden></p>
        <a class="btn-cta" id="scanFallbackCta" data-signup href="{{ site.studio }}/signup{% if language.code != 'en' %}?lang={{ language.code }}{% endif %}">{% t %}Start my studio →{% endt %}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<script src="{{ '/assets/js/scan.js' | asset }}" defer></script>

{#- The product in one frame (#1398): Leads for you as a drawn window, the
    cast the whole site uses (Ledgerpost pitching freight forwarders), and
    under it the three facts the frame shows. Drawn, never a screenshot: a
    capture goes stale the week the studio moves a menu (data/demo.json is
    from 8 Oct and the nav changed on 4 Nov). Every row is example content. -#}
<section class="hs" style="padding-top:0" id="product">
  <div class="col home-col">
    <div class="panel" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="frame">
        <div class="frame-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>studio.prospektor.ai · {% t %}Leads for you{% endt %}</span></div>
        <div class="frame-body">
          <div class="frame-nav">
            <div class="ws"><i>L</i>Ledgerpost</div>
            <span class="k">{% t %}Explore{% endt %}</span>
            <span class="on">{% t %}Leads for you{% endt %}</span>
            <span class="k">{% t %}Find{% endt %}</span>
            <span>{% t %}Companies{% endt %}</span>
            <span>{% t %}People{% endt %}</span>
            <span>{% t %}Intros{% endt %}</span>
            <span class="k">{% t %}Research{% endt %}</span>
            <span>{% t %}Competitors{% endt %}</span>
            <span>{% t %}Inbound{% endt %}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="frame-main">
            <div class="fh"><b>{% t %}Leads for you{% endt %}</b><span>{% t %}Scored this morning{% endt %}</span></div>
            <div class="lead"><span class="lg b">B</span><span class="nm"><b>Brightwater Forwarding</b><span>{% t %}Same volume band, same in-house customs desk{% endt %}</span></span><span class="fit">88 {% t %}fit{% endt %}</span><span class="pill">{% t %}Push to HubSpot{% endt %}</span></div>
            <div class="lead"><span class="lg o">C</span><span class="nm"><b>Calder Shipping Group</b><span>{% t %}Hiring a customs lead this month{% endt %}</span></span><span class="fit">84 {% t %}fit{% endt %}</span><span class="pill done">{% t %}In HubSpot{% endt %} ✓</span></div>
            <div class="lead"><span class="lg g">T</span><span class="nm"><b>Talbot &amp; Vance Logistics</b><span>{% t %}Adjacent region, the same margin complaint in public{% endt %}</span></span><span class="fit">74 {% t %}fit{% endt %}</span><span class="pill">{% t %}Push to HubSpot{% endt %}</span></div>
            <div class="lead"><span class="lg v">K</span><span class="nm"><b>Kestrel Freight</b><span>{% t %}Like Northwind, one of your customers{% endt %}</span></span><span class="fit low">61 {% t %}fit{% endt %}</span><span class="pill">{% t %}Push to HubSpot{% endt %}</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="caps3">
        <div><b>{% t %}Scored{% endt %}</b><p>{% t %}A fit score with its reasons, never a guess{% endt %}</p></div>
        <div><b>{% t %}Who decides{% endt %}</b><p>{% t %}The people to write to, with a source behind each name{% endt %}</p></div>
        <div><b>{% t %}One press to your CRM{% endt %}</b><p>{% t %}Company, people, deal and note, in your pipeline{% endt %}</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{#- Three steps (#1398), shootpick's "Selection happens in the room": a grey
    card each, the drawn preview on top, the number in coral. The first step
    is the free scan above. -#}
<section class="hs band" id="steps">
  <div class="col home-col">
    <div class="sec-h">
      <h2>{% t %}Three steps.<br>The first one is free.{% endt %}</h2>
      <p>{% t %}You keep selling the way you do. Prospektor handles everything between your website and your pipeline.{% endt %}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="steps3">
      <div class="stepc">
        <div class="shot" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="small">{% t %}What you sell{% endt %}</span>
          <div class="scanf">ledgerpost.com<b>{% t %}Find my leads{% endt %}</b></div>
          <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:4px"><span class="pill">{% t %}Your best customers{% endt %}</span><span class="pill">{% t %}A competitor{% endt %}</span><span class="pill">{% t %}A list you upload{% endt %}</span></div>
        </div>
        <span class="n">01</span>
        <h3>{% t %}Tell it what you sell{% endt %}</h3>
        <p>{% t %}Give it your website. Add your best customers, a competitor or a list from a conference, and it looks for more companies like them.{% endt %}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stepc">
        <div class="shot" aria-hidden="true">
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px"><span class="lg o" style="width:36px;height:36px;font-size:15px">C</span><span class="nm"><b style="font-size:15px">Calder Shipping Group</b><span>calder-shipping.com</span></span><span class="fit" style="font-size:22px">84</span></div>
          <p style="margin:6px 0 0;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.45">{% t %}Nine people retype customs filings by hand, and their investor update names customs delay as the top drag on margin.{% endt %}</p>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap"><span class="pill for">{% t %}For: hiring a customs lead{% endt %}</span><span class="pill against">{% t %}Against: a two-year contract{% endt %}</span></div>
        </div>
        <span class="n">02</span>
        <h3>{% t %}Read the shortlist{% endt %}</h3>
        <p>{% t %}Each company comes scored, with the reasons on both sides, the people who decide and a first email in your voice.{% endt %}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stepc">
        <div class="shot" aria-hidden="true">
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px"><img src="{{ '/assets/img/integrations/hubspot.svg' | asset }}" alt="" width="22" height="22"><b style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600">HubSpot</b><span class="pill dark" style="margin-left:auto">{% t %}Pushed{% endt %}</span></div>
          <div class="kv">
            <div><span>{% t %}Company{% endt %}</span><b>Calder Shipping Group</b></div>
            <div><span>{% t %}Contacts{% endt %}</span><b>Marieke de Vries, Jonas Albers</b></div>
            <div><span>{% t %}Deal{% endt %}</span><b>{% t %}New · Pilot on the Rotterdam lane{% endt %}</b></div>
            <div><span>{% t %}Note{% endt %}</span><b>{% t %}Fit 84 and the angle{% endt %}</b></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span class="n">03</span>
        <h3>{% t %}Send it to your CRM{% endt %}</h3>
        <p>{% t %}One press writes the company, its people, a deal in your first stage and a note. From there your team works the way it always has.{% endt %}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{#- Keep your CRM (#1396, 17 Nov 2026). The operator: "it becomes very
    clear that prospector sits on top of any CRM that you use and it's
    responsible for finding the right companies that fit the leads you're
    looking for and then feeding them into your CRM where you run your
    standardized sales process", in the shape of shootpick.com's how-it-works
    map. Where leads come from above (one tile per door the studio has, each a
    live help article), Prospektor as the one dark hub, the CRMs the studio
    connects below (the same seven as the integrations grid, each tile the door
    to its page), and a side panel that reads out the part under the pointer
    (flow.js). It replaced #838's row of chips, which said the same thing in
    one line. The vendors' marks are the directory's own files (#841). -#}
<section class="hs" id="crm">
  <div class="col home-col">
    <div class="sec-h">
      <h2>{% t %}Keep your CRM.{% endt %}</h2>
      <p>{% t %}Prospektor sits on top of the CRM you already run. Your pipeline, your stages and your follow-up stay where they are.{% endt %}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flowmap" data-flowmap>
      <div class="fm">
        <p class="fm-cap">{% t %}Where leads come from{% endt %}</p>
        <div class="fm-row">
        <button type="button" class="fm-in" data-step="in"><span class="fm-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18M12 3a14 14 0 0 1 0 18M12 3a14 14 0 0 0 0 18"/></svg></span><span class="fm-lbl">{% t %}Your website{% endt %}</span></button>
        <button type="button" class="fm-in" data-step="in"><span class="fm-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 3 2.7 5.6 6.1.8-4.5 4.3 1.1 6.1L12 17l-5.4 2.8 1.1-6.1L3.2 9.4l6.1-.8z"/></svg></span><span class="fm-lbl">{% t %}Your best customers{% endt %}</span></button>
        <button type="button" class="fm-in" data-step="in"><span class="fm-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 21V4M5 4h12l-2 4 2 4H5"/></svg></span><span class="fm-lbl">{% t %}A competitor’s customers{% endt %}</span></button>
        <button type="button" class="fm-in" data-step="in"><span class="fm-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="3" width="16" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M8 8h8M8 12h8M8 16h5"/></svg></span><span class="fm-lbl">{% t %}A list you upload{% endt %}</span></button>
        <button type="button" class="fm-in" data-step="in"><span class="fm-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3.5"/><path d="M2.5 20c.8-3.6 3.4-5.5 6.5-5.5s5.7 1.9 6.5 5.5"/><circle cx="17" cy="9" r="2.5"/><path d="M17 14c2.4 0 4 1.5 4.5 4"/></svg></span><span class="fm-lbl">{% t %}People you know{% endt %}</span></button>
        <button type="button" class="fm-in" data-step="in"><span class="fm-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16v11H9l-5 4z"/><path d="M8 9h8M8 12h5"/></svg></span><span class="fm-lbl">{% t %}An inbound lead{% endt %}</span></button>
        </div>
        <div class="fm-bus" aria-hidden="true"><span class="v"></span><span class="h"></span><span class="v"></span></div>
        <button type="button" class="fm-hub is-on" data-step="hub"><b><i><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 6C2 3.79 3.79 2 6 2s4 1.79 4 4-1.79 4-4 4" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="1.2" fill="white"/></svg></i>Prospektor</b><span>{% t %}Scores the fit · names who decides · writes the first email{% endt %}</span></button>
        <div class="fm-bus" aria-hidden="true"><span class="v"></span><span class="h bot"></span><span class="v"></span></div>
        <p class="fm-cap">{% t %}Your CRM{% endt %}</p>
        <div class="fm-row crm">
          {#- The operator, 17 Nov 2026: "keep reevo out as they're quite
              competitive to what we do. Also use the actual CRMs we have
              (Salesforce is missing)". Salesforce has no page of its own yet,
              so its tile opens the directory. -#}
          {%- for c in [['hubspot', 'HubSpot'], ['salesforce', 'Salesforce'], ['attio', 'Attio'], ['close', 'Close'], ['affinity', 'Affinity'], ['lightfield', 'Lightfield'], ['highlevel', 'HighLevel']] %}
          <a class="fm-out" data-step="crm" href="{{ (('/integrations/' + c[0] + '/') if c[0] != 'salesforce' else '/integrations/') | localize }}"><span class="fm-ic"><img src="{{ ('/assets/img/integrations/' + c[0] + '.svg') | asset }}" alt="" width="22" height="22"></span><span class="fm-lbl">{{ c[1] }}</span></a>
          {%- endfor %}
        </div>
        <p class="fm-foot">{% t %}Your sales process runs there, as it does today.{% endt %}</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="fm-panel">
        <div data-pane="in" hidden>
          <p class="k">{% t %}1 · Where leads come from{% endt %}</p>
          <h3>{% t %}Start from what you already have{% endt %}</h3>
          <p>{% t %}Prospektor reads your website and asks who you sell to. Point it at your best customers, a competitor, a list from a conference or the people you know, and it finds more companies like them.{% endt %}</p>
          <p class="hint">{% t %}Hover or tap any part of the diagram.{% endt %}</p>
        </div>
        <div data-pane="hub">
          <p class="k">{% t %}2 · Prospektor{% endt %}</p>
          <h3>{% t %}Finds the fit, writes the pitch{% endt %}</h3>
          <p>{% t %}Each company gets a fit score with the reasons, the names of the people who decide, and a first email in your voice. Wins and losses you record sharpen the next one.{% endt %}</p>
          <p class="hint">{% t %}Hover or tap any part of the diagram.{% endt %}</p>
        </div>
        <div data-pane="crm" hidden>
          <p class="k">{% t %}3 · Your CRM{% endt %}</p>
          <h3>{% t %}One press, and it is in your pipeline{% endt %}</h3>
          <p>{% t %}Prospektor writes the company, its people, a deal in your first stage and a note with the fit and the angle. Push again and the same records update. From there your team works the way it always has.{% endt %}</p>
          <a class="lnk" href="{{ '/integrations/' | localize }}">{% t %}All integrations{% endt %} ›</a>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<script src="{{ '/assets/js/flow.js' | asset }}" defer></script>

{#- What you get (#1398, out of #1279's four columns): six short items in
    shootpick's "What you get back" grid, each a door into a product page.
    Keeps id="what" on the section and id="how" on the grid, so old deep
    links to either land here; the two product pages' sections are the
    fragments the columns always pointed at. -#}
<section class="hs band" id="what">
  <div class="col home-col">
    <h2 class="sec-h2">{% t %}What you get.{% endt %}</h2>
    <div class="icons6" id="how">
      <a href="{{ '/who-to-pitch/' | localize }}"><span class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m20 20-4-4"/></svg></span><h3>{% t %}Companies that fit{% endt %}</h3><p>{% t %}Lookalikes of your best customers, who buys from a rival, and new fits waiting when you log in.{% endt %}</p></a>
      <a href="{{ '/who-to-pitch/' | localize }}#warm-intros"><span class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3.5"/><path d="M2.5 20c.8-3.6 3.4-5.5 6.5-5.5s5.7 1.9 6.5 5.5"/><circle cx="17" cy="9" r="2.5"/><path d="M17 14c2.4 0 4 1.5 4.5 4"/></svg></span><h3>{% t %}The people who decide{% endt %}</h3><p>{% t %}Named, with their LinkedIn and a work email, and a source behind every name.{% endt %}</p></a>
      <a href="{{ '/who-to-pitch/' | localize }}#warm-intros"><span class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h5l2 4 3-8 2 4h4"/></svg></span><h3>{% t %}Warm intros{% endt %}</h3><p>{% t %}Who in your network can introduce you, with your ask and the note to forward already drafted.{% endt %}</p></a>
      <a href="{{ '/what-to-send/' | localize }}"><span class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16v11H9l-5 4z"/><path d="M8 9h8M8 12h5"/></svg></span><h3>{% t %}The pitch, in your voice{% endt %}</h3><p>{% t %}Cold email, deck, one-pager and proposal for each company, built on what has worked for you.{% endt %}</p></a>
      <a href="{{ '/what-to-send/' | localize }}"><span class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 4h4l2 5-2.5 1.5a11 11 0 0 0 5 5L15 13l5 2v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A16 16 0 0 1 3 6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2"/></svg></span><h3>{% t %}A sheet for every call{% endt %}</h3><p>{% t %}Name the company and the call. A minute later you have the goal, the talking points and the objection to expect.{% endt %}</p></a>
      <a href="{{ '/what-to-send/' | localize }}#in-your-voice"><span class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 18h6M10 21h4"/><path d="M12 3a6 6 0 0 0-3.5 10.9c.6.5 1 1.2 1 2.1h5c0-.9.4-1.6 1-2.1A6 6 0 0 0 12 3z"/></svg></span><h3>{% t %}Sharper every pitch{% endt %}</h3><p>{% t %}Your edits teach it how you write. Wins and losses you record shape the next one.{% endt %}</p></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{#- The thesis, priced. Keeps id="pricing": Stripe's cancel_url is /#pricing
    (test/checkout-session.test.js) and old deep links land here. #1097: the
    paid card's link opens the studio's sign-up, finished by signup.js. -#}
<section class="hs" id="pricing">
  <div class="col home-col">
    <div class="sec-h">
      <h2>{% t %}Who to pitch is free.{% endt %}</h2>
      <p>{% t %}What to send is one workspace, one price, your whole team in.{% endt %}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid2 price" style="max-width:920px;margin:0 auto">
      <div class="hcard band">
        <p class="hcard-q">{% t %}Who to pitch{% endt %}</p>
        <b class="big">{% t %}Free{% endt %}</b>
        <p class="per">{% t %}No card, no sign-up to start{% endt %}</p>
        <ul class="ticks">
          <li>{% t %}Your site read, and what you should hunt for{% endt %}</li>
          <li>{% t %}Three companies that fit, scored{% endt %}</li>
          <li>{% t %}Who buys from one of your competitors{% endt %}</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="hcard-foot"><a href="#scan">{% t %}Scan your site{% endt %} ›</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="hcard">
        <p class="hcard-q">{% t %}What to send{% endt %}</p>
        <b class="big">{% t %}$999 a month{% endt %}</b>
        <p class="per">{% t %}or $9,990 a year, two months free{% endt %}</p>
        <ul class="ticks">
          <li>{% t %}Every pitch: deck, one-pager, cold email, proposal{% endt %}</li>
          <li>{% t %}Warm intros from your network{% endt %}</li>
          <li>{% t %}Replies to inbound, and a sheet for every call{% endt %}</li>
          <li>{% t %}Your whole team, no seats to count{% endt %}</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="hcard-foot buy" id="buy"><a class="btn-cta" href="{{ site.studio }}/signup{% if language.code != 'en' %}?lang={{ language.code }}{% endif %}" id="buyLink" data-signup>{% t %}Start my studio →{% endt %}</a> <a class="quiet" href="{{ '/pricing/' | localize }}">{% t %}See pricing{% endt %} ›</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<script src="{{ '/assets/js/signup.js' | asset }}" defer></script>

{#- The close (#1398): one dark band, one line, the same press as the hero. -#}
<section class="close-band">
  <h2>{% t %}Keep your CRM. Add Prospektor.{% endt %}</h2>
  <p>{% t %}Scan your site and see the first three companies, free.{% endt %}</p>
  <a class="btn-cta" href="#scan">{% t %}Scan your site{% endt %}</a>
</section>
